# service | image | purpose
adguardhome   | adguard/adguardhome:latest                 | network-wide ad blocking + DNS
pihole        | pihole/pihole:latest                       | alt ad blocker (pick one)
caddy         | caddy:latest                               | reverse proxy + auto TLS
portainer     | portainer/portainer-ce:latest              | container management UI
homepage      | ghcr.io/gethomepage/homepage:latest        | dashboard
uptime-kuma   | louislam/uptime-kuma:latest                | service uptime monitoring
filebrowser   | filebrowser/filebrowser:latest             | web file manager
jellyfin      | jellyfin/jellyfin:latest                   | media server (VA-API on Vega 3)
vaultwarden   | vaultwarden/server:latest                  | password manager
immich        | ghcr.io/immich-app/immich-server:release   | photo backup
nextcloud     | nextcloud:latest                           | files/calendar/contacts
watchtower    | containrrr/watchtower:latest               | auto-update containers
dozzle        | amir20/dozzle:latest                       | container log viewer
